Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Mobile Web|
		|testray.main.component.name|User Interface|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Preview Custom Default
Priority: 3
	Given MobileDevice preview PG
		|deviceType|custom|

Scenario: Preview Custom Height Width
Priority: 3
	Given MobileDevice preview PG
		|deviceType|custom|
		|height|500|
		|width|500|

Scenario: Preview Desktop
Priority: 3
	Given MobileDevice preview PG
		|deviceType|desktop|

Scenario: Preview Smartphone
Priority: 3
	Given MobileDevice preview PG
		|deviceType|smartphone|

Scenario: Preview Tablet
Priority: 3
	Given MobileDevice preview PG
		|deviceType|tablet|